Activating this talent enhances your reflexes to incredible levels.  Each time you are attacked in melee, you have a [-3%, 16%, 26%, 32%, 36% (TL1-5)] chance get a defensive shot off in time to intercept the attack, fully disrupting it (including extra blows from certain talents), dealing [62%, 71%, 78%, 84%, 90% (TL1-5)] archery damage, and knocking the attacker back [0, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] tiles.

Activating this talent will not interrupt reloading.
